TradingAgents-A-share (working title)
=====================================

This repository is a fork of Tauric Research's TradingAgents, branch 0.7.x
(https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents), used under the Apache-2.0
license. The upstream copyright and license notices are retained.

A-share localization
--------------------
The A-share data vendor and the policy / hot-money / lockup analysts are
adapted from:

  - simonlin1212/TradingAgents-astock (Apache-2.0)
    https://github.com/simonlin1212/tradingagents-astock
  - hkwsg/TradingAgents-A-share (Apache-2.0)
    https://github.com/hkwsg/TradingAgents-A-share

Portions copied from those projects keep their original copyright headers
and carry a note naming the source and the local changes.

Data
----
A-share data is fetched from free public sources (mootdx, Eastmoney, Sina,
Tencent, AkShare). It is for personal research only and is not redistributed.
